Load the Macro: 


Assign a Key: Assign the macro to your desired key (default is P).


Activate in Game: During a goal kick, press the assigned key to perform an ultra-fast shot.


Test and Optimize: If necessary, tweak the delay value to suit your preferred speed and power.


